    "body": "> I suppose you could return early somehow for a speculative fetch. What does ignoring mean though? Not invoking fetch at all?\r\n\r\nI added a step to the processing model, aborting early at the UA's discretion. I think it'd be better to notify the developer that prefetch is being ignored.",
